ins User and the list is empty. Initial redirection returns at its single-foe/list-size guard.","After ordinary PP/history and initial whole-use admission, Protean changes current type to GHOST. The specific late Curse branch clears preselection and reconstructs a RandomNearFoe list, with fixed result seat3.","This branch calls the target-construction operation only. The next phase performs empty-list/initial success checks; it does not revisit redirection. Seat3 receives Curse and user HP becomes51, while seat1 remains uncursed despite Follow Me.","Applying the §5.1 normal construction-plus-redirection chain a second time would instead select seat1; that behavior is not the fixed-reference late branch."],"consumer":{"EXACT_VALUE_ALREADY_DISPLAYED_AT":"/normative_records/15/bidirectional_evidence/necessary_consumers"},"definition_vs_wiring":"仅按本记录的具体前提与实际consumer定位；不由名称存在推默认接线。"}}
